582	//       once its ID is present in the right env var / config file / launch
583	//       arg — ark, dst, squad, soulmask, unturned, projectzomboid, tf2 all
584	//       work this way, confirmed against either the game's own wiki or (for
585	//       the Docker-run families this platform actually provisions) the exact
586	//       image's own documented env vars; or
