905	 *  image) — this used to write a hardcoded `/opt/unturned/Servers/nxeon`,
906	 *  which was only right for fragsoc/unturned (prisma/seed-wave2-games.ts:
907	 *  `-v /opt/unturned:/config -e SERVER_ID=nxeon`). Production's live
908	 *  `unturned` OsTemplate has run imperialplugins/unturned since Wave 7:
909	 *  `-v /opt/unturned:/home/steam/Unturned/Servers -e SERVER_NAME='Nxeon Unturned'`
