911	 *  (Servers/Servers/nxeon from the game's side) was never read: every Unturned
912	 *  Workshop install reported INSTALLED while the server ignored it. The real
913	 *  folder isn't even derivable from the env var: the image launches
914	 *  `+secureserver/"$SERVER_NAME"`, and a live server named "Nxeon Unturned"
915	 *  created `/opt/unturned/Nxeon Unturned"` — with a trailing double quote,
916	 *  from the engine's own command-line quoting. So the folder is DISCOVERED:
